\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Reference-fidelity quality by classifier, dataset (rows), fitted seed (columns), and nominal coalition allowance. Studied values average six repeats per input/background cell; library values use the single stored package call in each cell. Lines only connect categorical conditions to aid comparison. No error bars are supplied because budget-specific uncertainty estimates are not retained. The library is not the supplied independent-sampling baseline.}}{8}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:comparison}{{4}{8}{Reference-fidelity quality by classifier, dataset (rows), fitted seed (columns), and nominal coalition allowance. Studied values average six repeats per input/background cell; library values use the single stored package call in each cell. Lines only connect categorical conditions to aid comparison. No error bars are supplied because budget-specific uncertainty estimates are not retained. The library is not the supplied independent-sampling baseline}{figure.caption.8}{}}
