\newlabel{tab:cost}{{2}{8}{Measured work per call, averaged over inputs, fits, and classifier families within each displayed dataset/background/budget condition. Row counts are constant within each condition. Studied time is wall-clock seconds; library time is process CPU seconds. These clocks must not be interpreted as a speedup comparison}{table.caption.9}{}}
